{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1000_p", "source_sha256": "23f96435684818b96d211ba687a1fea7ff8fa5451683a2e857c4ab47b8582de8", "ja": "（星梨花に、話したい事があると呼び出された。\n何か悩みでもあるんだろうか……？）", "zh": "（星梨花找我过来，说有事跟我说。\n会是有什么烦恼吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "594842e7d81dca7cb850e407e9ea2775e9d144cded61ad86cebcbf14737fc182", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　あの、わたし、今日は\n{$P$}さんにお礼が言いたくて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那个，我今天，想向{$P$}道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "8a20cf273ca5f1bcc0826223c2c16111a3d941d28f49f47c40a87e83c25f68d3", "ja": "わたしをお嫁さんにしてくれて、\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "非常谢谢你，\n让我成为新娘！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0dcb57d86677e67f8a8f0768f1c141c8cb92b73a497972fb89716a521fa3632a", "ja": "あぁ、お嫁さんに……って、え？", "zh": "哦，成为新娘……呃，什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "c7c3ceebde3ef0ff7deeae77e441e1b9b63506831520a5f130af3a47507015fe", "ja": "この前、ウェディングドレスを着せてもらって、\nお嫁さんにしてもらったの……やっぱり変でしたか？", "zh": "前阵子，你让我穿上婚纱，成为新娘了啊……\n还是说我穿起来其实很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "806390bbc565c10c449d2239b64d07ce2f547c0e5be1a08b81608fb15d046681", "ja": "あ、そのことか。\nいや、ちっとも変じゃない。よく似合ってたよ！", "zh": "啊，原来是那件事啊。\n不，一点都不奇怪。你穿起来很好看喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "e6a636ea7c8cfb40775648ac09aca3cc62fd5f6cf9312ad7621382bb2ea7195d", "ja": "えへへ、よかった♪　わたし、ウェディングドレスの\n撮影って聞いて、すごくドキドキしてたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n当我听说要拍婚纱时，还一直很紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "f2f75daa19695ea65cb251d619b0a520f5383f245b4d36927e31ed56cfd73fed", "ja": "でも、わたしはフラワーガールだから\nウェディングドレスは着れないって思ってました。", "zh": "不过，当时我是花童，\n本来还以为穿不到婚纱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "97349c629905c1abb8a7acf4a005c1737b8393abc7996f3897a1ab0e4723ca26", "ja": "だから{$P$}さんが、わたしにも\nドレスを着せてくれて、すごくうれしかったんです！", "zh": "所以{$P$}先生也让我穿上婚纱，\n我真的好高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ce3c9eaa9a54d86ef957ab7131b2905948329190faefbdec8f385a7346a4ea03", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nよかったな、星梨花！", "zh": "哈哈，是嘛。\n那太好了呢，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "d3288d1524913bcf81dac759e0bea0aad972bc4e9e777cf61568ec17d582f42b", "ja": "はい♪　あのときわたしの携帯で撮ってもらった写真、\n家に帰って、パパとママにも見せてあげました！", "zh": "是啊♪那时候你帮忙用我的手机拍的照片，\n我回家后也有拿给爸爸妈妈看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "29bc9e26d9e0c1b2a8d1ee26197cab0e5a368e89d4d9905c77ccda813a9b70f6", "ja": "でも……ママはすごく喜んでくれたんですけど、\nパパが、急に泣き出しちゃったんです……。", "zh": "不过……虽然妈妈看了很高兴，\n爸爸却突然哭了起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "d983241b9dcb4d06a092850a358d9da04837f8555a7a610373966a86e522dc98", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nどうしてかわかりますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你知道他为什么会哭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6dbb4f5365b55b7cb3c3b2d8493904c37613880ed3fd36125b535728950738f2", "ja": "あー、それは……。たぶん、星梨花が\n本当に結婚した時の事を想像しちゃったのかな……。", "zh": "嗯～这个嘛……\n他大概是想像了星梨花真的结婚时的景象吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "ab092127ce419a682df180ac8ca67d1dd5672e8299de13dc02753c24a80547fa", "ja": "そうなんですか？　でも、どうして泣いちゃうのかな。\nパパはわたしが結婚したら、悲しいのかな……？", "zh": "是吗？可是为什么会哭呢？\n要是我结婚，爸爸会很难过吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4cf8be033ecc5b181411bd8b03aa7cd90121dcdca5ddb889330568a2182c3d9a", "ja": "うーん……すごく嬉しいけど、同じくらい\n寂しくなるんじゃないかな。きっと複雑なんだよ。", "zh": "唔……应该在高兴之余，同时感到很寂寞吧。\n他的心情想必很复杂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "2b4bb0e2cc36ba408a3702c21fcdd4f564f72489a753de6763f59a1a77034029", "ja": "そうなんですか……\n男の人は、複雑なんですね！", "zh": "是这样吗……\n你们男生还真是复杂呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "e2834285f74422bb6f77d69bb78e6201e46e4fd3046572b880ac166198a53172", "ja": "あっ、パパにも、{$P$}さんが\nわたしをお嫁さんにしてくれたって伝えておきました♪", "zh": "啊，我也有跟爸爸说，\n{$P$}先生让我成为新娘♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "39d1d751d753a34c0da73348caea7c578553cdc671fa14842ad2e9f88466564a", "ja": "今度、きちんとお礼がしたいって言ってました。\nパパが来たら、よろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "他说下次想要好好向你道谢。\n要是爸爸来了，就请你多多关照啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0063_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e8a5bef12c3859ae347c491dd2f1abd809cb8f56a52cc8fce2b7c731184989da", "ja": "そうか、星梨花のお父さんが……\n誤解されてないといいな！", "zh": "这样啊，星梨花的父亲要……\n真希望他没有误会什么啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
